# Manifold replay 27
# Phase 4, what a body can do: aiming up and down apart from where it looks, a ball thrown where it aims.
# A reference replay (stage 2.5a): playing it must end with the hash on its last line. A refactor
# keeps it bit for bit. Recorded by games/dojo/src/reference.test.ts; recorded again (npm run
# references) only when the simulation changes on purpose, with SIMULATION_VERSION.
game dojo
profile rapier-deterministic server 60
birth seed 9
birth dojo.level course
change 31 dojo.goto 0 1 6
input 31 1 face @0 pitch 0.4
input 35 1 face @0 pitch 0.4 dojo.throw
input 36 1 face @0 pitch 0.4
input 121 1 face @0 pitch -0.15
input 125 1 face @0 pitch -0.15 dojo.throw
input 126 1 face @0 pitch -0.15
input 211 1 face @90 pitch 0.8
input 215 1 face @90 pitch 0.8 dojo.throw
input 216 1 face @90 pitch 0.8
end 330 d277d6f1
